# One-off n8n/Supabase admin & debug scripts — these hardcode live API
# keys (n8n admin key, Supabase service_role key) and must never be
# committed. GitHub Pages serves every tracked file in this repo publicly,
# so an untracked file here is the only thing keeping its secrets private.
